    * <th>Stack concept</th>
    * <th>DoubleEndedQueueInterface Method</th>
    * </tr>
    * </thead>
    * <tbody>
    * <tr>
    * <td><em>push</em></td>
    * <td><code>addFirst()</code></td>
    * </tr>
    * <tr>
    * <td><em>pop</em></td>
    * <td><code>removeFirst()</code></td>
    * </tr>
    * <tr>
    * <td><em>peek</em></td>
    * <td><code>peekFirst()</code></td>
    * </tr>
